# No rewrite. The module is addressed as /opx/index.php and takes its route
# from what follows: /opx/index.php/generate, /opx/index.php/health. That is
# what agent_url in agt/config-ai-openai-compatible.php points at, and what
# the smoke harness's --base-url expects.
#
# opxResolveRoute() reads PATH_INFO first and falls back to the trailing URI
# segment, so the route resolves whether or not this host's PHP handler
# populates PATH_INFO. Nothing here depends on mod_rewrite, RewriteBase, or
# the module being served at any particular URL path.
#
# This file needs "AllowOverride All". Require all denied is in the AuthConfig
# override class and <FilesMatch> is Override: All, so a narrower grant does
# not skip this file - Apache returns 500 for every request in the directory.

# index.php is the only file here meant to be reachable over HTTP.
# Everything else is denied by name, so the whole directory can be copied to
# the docroot without exposing anything:
#
#   config.php         this instance's shared key, and on an instance fronting
#                      a hosted account a billable API key. PHP includes it
#                      from disk; it is never served.
#   config.sample.php  holds no secret, but advertises the configuration shape.
#   README.md          internals and troubleshooting; would be served as plain
#                      text, unlike the .php files, which execute.
<FilesMatch "^(config\.php|config\.sample\.php|README\.md)$">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>
